==About==
The '''Esports World Cup''' is a tournament series that was announced in late 2023, building off the previously established '''Gamers8''' series. It was originally planned to be hosted in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia, but was moved to Paris, France on May 20.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/EWC_EN/status/2057121960623006162|title=Esports World Cup 2026 is coming to Paris|author=Esports World Cup|author-link=Esports World Cup|date=2026-05-20}}</ref>
:''See [https://liquipedia.net/esports/Esports_World_Cup/2026 here] to read about the Esports World Cup 2026, the Calendar, the Club Standings and more.''
:''See [https://www.faceit.com/zh/organizers/13565957-61e0-4e28-891d-18ebfba32890/Esports%20World%20Cup this FACEIT page] and also submit official Google Form to register for the EWC 2026 Teamfight Tactics Online Qualifier.''

===Format===
* '''Group Stage:''' ''July 21 - 23''
** 16 teams are split into 2 even groups of 8 teams.
** For each group, 8 teams compete in the Double-Elimination (GSL) format.
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}.
*** {{Abbr/Top4}} teams from each group advance to the ''Playoffs''.

*'''Playoffs:''' ''July 24 - 25''
** 8 teams qualified from ''Group Stage'' compete in the Single-Elimination format.
*** All matches ''(excl. Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}.
*** Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}}.

